=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the **Underpass Hatch** in {z:Batallia Downs (S)} at (J-9)/(K-9) for a cutscene. The Hatch is on the rampart inside of a tower.
** If you have progressed a bit in {p:Voidwatch}, you can use the {p:Atmacite Refiner} in {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} from the last mission's cutscene to get here swiftly. Otherwise, the {p:Campaign Arbiter|Campaign Arbiters} warp from your allied nation will get you somewhat close.

=3 A Nation on the Brink
!Everbloom Hollow-map15.jpg||The Everbloom Hollow map this fight is on
* Click the **Underpass Hatch** again to enter {z:Everbloom Hollow} for the **A Nation on the Brink** instance battlefield.
* Up to six players may enter at once as long as they have a {@k}{k:Underpass hatch key} or have completed the quest previously. The party leader must have the {@k}{k:Underpass hatch key} to take the party in.
* The objective is to defeat {m:One-eyed Gwajboj}, who will spawn once the waves of beastmen are defeated. He is a {p:Paladin} that may use {p:Invincible} multiple times.
* Trusts can be summoned.
* All of the mobs inside the instance are immune to all forms of Sleep. Bind and Gravity immunity unknown, but is generally the case for many WotG NMs. __(verification needed)__
* You will be assisted by 9 NPCs: {n:Rongelouts N Distaud}, {p:Zazarg|Zazarg (S)}, {p:Romaa Mihgo|Romaa Mihgo (S)}, Iron Ram Knights x2, 7th Cohors Legionnaires x2, Cobra Mercenaries x2.
** The NPCs will split up into groups according to their allegiance and will run to find two waves of mobs:
*** **Zazarg** and the 7th Cohors Legionnaires will fight a wave consisting of a {m:Ruby Quadav} and 4 {m:Nickel Quadavs|Nickel Quadav} in the Northwest. Once they are defeated, they will run in further to find a second wave consisting of 2 Ruby Quadavs and 3 Nickel Quadavs.
*** **Rongelouts N Distaud** and the Iron Ram Knights will fight a wave consisting of an {m:Orcish Hexspinner} and 4 {m:Orcish Gladiators|Orcish Gladiator} in the Northeast. Once they are defeated, they will run forward to find a second wave consisting of 2 Orcish Hexspinners and 3 Orcish Gladiators.
*** **Romaa Mihgo** and the Cobra Mercenaries will fight a wave consisting of a {m:Yagudo Abbot} and 4 {m:Yagudo Missionaries|Yagudo Missionary} in the South. Once defeated, they will run forward to find a second wave consisting of 2 Yagudo Abbots and 3 Yagudo Missionaries.

=3 Wrap Up
* Once you defeat **One-eyed Gwajboj**, you will receive a cutscene and the {i:Jeunoan Flag|Jeunoan Flag|184}, completing the mission.
** If your inventory is full, you will be able to retrieve it from the **???** just to the north of the fight's entrance on top of some barrels.
* You will be able to continue the national storylines with the following quests:
** {q:Quelling the Storm|Quelling the Storm|Quelling the Storm} (if aligned with Bastok in the past)
** {q:The Price of Valor|The Price of Valor|The Price of Valor} (if aligned with San d'Oria in the past)
** {q:The Long March North|The Long March North|The Long March North} (if aligned with Windurst in the past)

